{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"牛頭角女子遭客貨車撞倒　昏迷送院搶救\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-NTK-261114-14.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】牛頭角一名女途人被客貨車撞到，昏迷送院急救。</p><p>傷者送到伊利沙伯醫院急救，涉事車輛車頭輕微損毀，旁邊留下一對鞋。警方中午12時許接獲報案，指一輛客貨車沿牛頭角通明街右轉入牛頭角道時，撞倒一名過路女子，她受傷昏迷不醒，救護人員接報到場，由救護車送院搶救。司機在場協助調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:01:55.960514+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:08:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:05.151859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:55:26.540263+00:00","content_hash":"925d70ff792b57f7096d2669f24bbadc89faf0f7db71e3bc1d9be98add0fd74e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:01:55.960514+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}